{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391340/extras/Unserious_Sandbox.jpg?t=1745307652\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unserious Sandbox</strong> is a physics sandbox, an abstract space just for fun.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Desktop Wallpaper</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game makes a not bad wallpaper.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Parkour</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The current gameplay of Unserious Sandbox centers around player movements. Roam free, experiment with different moves, and explore various routes as your skills progress.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Ragdoll</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">On-demand ragdoll physics simulation when you play in sandbox maps. Embrace the chaos and master the art of falling flat.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Sandbox</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ultimately, Unserious Sandbox is a sandbox with an unserious Sandbox\u2014not just a sandbox, but also the character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391340/extras/redmaple.png?t=1745307652\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3391340?t=1745307652","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3391340?t=1745307652","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391340/fcf20a31e65f8d7a2fee6f8776240f8d2dd44e00/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745307652","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391340/fcf20a31e65f8d7a2fee6f8776240f8d2dd44e00/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745307652","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://sh